flowchart TB
    CLI[CLI and layered config] --> TASK[Task/run workspace]
    TASK --> PLAN[Plan producer and verifier]
    PLAN --> PHASE[Phase plan]
    PHASE --> IMPL[Implement producer and reviewer per phase]
    IMPL --> TEST[Test author and auditor per phase]
    TEST --> DONE[Verifier-gated completion]
    PLAN -->|question| QA[Human/automatic clarification]
    IMPL -->|question| QA
    TEST -->|question| QA
    QA --> LEDGER[Decisions, raw logs, events, session state]
    LEDGER --> PLAN
    LEDGER --> IMPL
    LEDGER --> TEST
